+# CONTRACT — Permission Maze Document Management API
+
+`createApp()` exported from `src/app.ts` returns an Express app. In-memory storage only.
+
+## Auth
+- [ ] POST /auth/register {username,password} → 201 {id,username} → test
+- [ ] register missing username/password → 400
+- [ ] register duplicate username → 409
+- [ ] POST /auth/login {username,password} → 200 {token}
+- [ ] login wrong password / unknown user → 401
+- [ ] protected route without token → 401
+- [ ] protected route with invalid token → 401
+
+## Folders
+- [ ] POST /folders {name,parentId?} → 201, creator is owner
+- [ ] POST /folders missing name → 400
+- [ ] POST /folders with nonexistent parentId → 404
+- [ ] POST /folders into a folder you cannot edit → 403
+- [ ] GET /folders/:id as owner/viewer → 200; nonexistent → 404; no access → 403
+- [ ] PUT /folders/:id (name/parentId) as editor → 200; viewer → 403
+- [ ] DELETE /folders/:id as owner → 204; editor → 403; cascades delete of contents
+
+## Documents
+- [ ] POST /documents {title,content,folderId} → 201, creator is owner
+- [ ] POST /documents missing title/folderId → 400
+- [ ] POST /documents nonexistent folder → 404
+- [ ] POST /documents into folder without edit access → 403
+- [ ] GET /documents/:id viewer → 200; no access → 403; nonexistent → 404
+- [ ] PUT /documents/:id editor → 200; viewer → 403
+- [ ] DELETE /documents/:id owner → 204; editor → 403
+
+## Sharing & Permissions
+- [ ] POST /:resourceType/:id/share {username,role} by owner → 201
+- [ ] share by editor with viewer/editor role → 201; granting 'owner' by editor → 403
+- [ ] share by viewer → 403
+- [ ] share invalid role → 400; nonexistent user → 404; nonexistent resource → 404
+- [ ] viewer can read but not modify; editor can read+modify+share; owner can delete
+- [ ] folder share cascades to documents/subfolders inside (inherited permission)
+- [ ] most-permissive wins across direct + inherited paths
+
+## Activity Log
+- [ ] GET /activity → 200 array; entries have {action,userId,resourceType,resourceId,timestamp}
+- [ ] records document create/update/delete and share events
+
+## Validation
+- [ ] npm run build clean
+- [ ] npm run lint clean
+- [ ] npm test passes
